<title>UK: FrankfurtHypo adds 500 mln Dem to April 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>FrankfurtHypo adds 500 mln Dem to April 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, originally launched in November 1996, has been increased to 2.0 billion marks from 1.5 billion marks, joint lead managers CDC, Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and HSBC Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANKFURT HYPOTHEKENBANK CENTRALBODEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    12.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.18     PAY DATE    20.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     LISTING    FFT	 PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  19 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED INNOVEMBER 1996</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
